@startuml WorkflowB_State_Diagram
!pragma layout smetana
hide empty description

state "Patient Summary View" as Summary
state "Individual Patient View" as Patient
state "Individual Assessment View" as Assessment
state "Annotation View" as Annotation
state "Individual Question View" as Question
state "Report View" as Report

[*] --> Summary
Summary --> Summary : View List of Patients
Summary --> Patient : Select Patient
Patient --> Summary : Return to Patient Summary View
Patient --> Patient : View Patient Assessment\nTrends and Previous Assessments
Patient --> Assessment : Select Assessment
Assessment --> Patient : Return to Patient Overview

Assessment --> Annotation : Open Annotation Tool
Annotation --> Annotation : Review Segments with Playback,\nEdit Text, Speaker, and Language,\nand Mark Segments as Verified
Annotation --> Assessment : Complete Annotation\n(Save to Assessment Record)

Assessment --> Assessment : Review and Interpret Results\nwith Annotated Transcript
Assessment --> Question : Select Question
Question --> Question : Review and Adjust Question
Question --> Assessment : Return to Individual\nAssessment View

Assessment --> Report : Generate and View Report
Report --> Report : Download Report
Report --> Assessment : Return to Individual\nAssessment View
@enduml
